        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/705eede50b9fc3f947b97e26270143b7.poster.avif?t=1759348024\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/705eede50b9fc3f947b97e26270143b7.webm?t=1759348024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/705eede50b9fc3f947b97e26270143b7.mp4?t=1759348024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2184.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mankind is on the brink of extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has been destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last remaining survivors have fled to planet Zerion 12 in order to colonize and repopulate the human race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is overrun by an alien species called Zektid's. You will need to lure them to the surface and clear the planet sector by sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is our only hope for humanities survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/be9fe6a1ed5ccc7029e14333ac1aa714.poster.avif?t=1759348024\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/be9fe6a1ed5ccc7029e14333ac1aa714.webm?t=1759348024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/be9fe6a1ed5ccc7029e14333ac1aa714.mp4?t=1759348024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime Tower Defense packed action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique sectors to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assortment of offensive and defensive towers to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart pumping soundtrack to fit the mood.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies and bosses to battle that come in waves.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for using your own custom music soundtracks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/0b00d6f76ac7c0791f9a831b0c1341e8.avif?t=1759348024\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE INFO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create towers of the offensive and defensive type to destroy waves of enemies. Every sector is a unique design with a unique soundtrack. Enemies will come in waves and various types. Slow enemies, fast enemies, armored enemies etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/705eede50b9fc3f947b97e26270143b7.poster.avif?t=1759348024\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/705eede50b9fc3f947b97e26270143b7.webm?t=1759348024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/705eede50b9fc3f947b97e26270143b7.mp4?t=1759348024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2184.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mankind is on the brink of extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth has been destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last remaining survivors have fled to planet Zerion 12 in order to colonize and repopulate the human race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is overrun by an alien species called Zektid's. You will need to lure them to the surface and clear the planet sector by sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is our only hope for humanities survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/be9fe6a1ed5ccc7029e14333ac1aa714.poster.avif?t=1759348024\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/be9fe6a1ed5ccc7029e14333ac1aa714.webm?t=1759348024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/be9fe6a1ed5ccc7029e14333ac1aa714.mp4?t=1759348024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realtime Tower Defense packed action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique sectors to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assortment of offensive and defensive towers to choose from.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart pumping soundtrack to fit the mood.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies and bosses to battle that come in waves.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for using your own custom music soundtracks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908920/extras/0b00d6f76ac7c0791f9a831b0c1341e8.avif?t=1759348024\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORE INFO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create towers of the offensive and defensive type to destroy waves of enemies. Every sector is a unique design with a unique soundtrack. Enemies will come in waves and various types. Slow enemies, fast enemies, armored enemies etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
